  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "You can create empty resource groups from <strong>Browse</strong> &gt; <strong>Resource groups</strong> via the <strong>Add</strong> command or by searching for \"resource group\" in the Azure Marketplace.\n\n<a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2015-07-resource-group.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2015-07-resource-group-200x300.png\" alt=\"Create new resource groups from the portal\"></a>",
    "Markdown": "You can create empty resource groups from Browse > Resource groups via the Add command or by searching for \"resource group\" in the Azure Marketplace."
  },
